  Values:
    Speaker: ""
    Portrait: 0
    Lines:
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: Mind the rows, love. The cabbages are nearly ready and the slimes know it.
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: The ground split right across the east field in the quake. Straight as a plough line, it was.
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: My husband swears he saw a light down in that crack. I told him it was the cider.
